<title>USA: Micro Therapeutics prices IPO.</title>
<headline>Micro Therapeutics prices IPO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN CLEMENTE, Calif. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Micro Therapeutics Inc on Wednesday said it has priced its initial public offering of 11.6 million shares of common stock at $6.00 per share.</p>
<p>The offering is being made by underwriters led by UBS Securities LLC and Volpe, Welty &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Micro Therapeutics develops, manufactures and markets minimally invasive medical devices for the diagnosis and treatment of vascular disease.</p>
